Description:
    Adds or updates an organization in data/organizations.yml. Sponsors (sponsors.yml) and
    involvements (involvements.yml) reference organizations by slug.

Example: Add an organization
    bin/rails g organization --name "AppSignal" --website https://www.appsignal.com \
      --logo_url https://rubyonrails.org/assets/images/logo-appsignal.svg

    This adds an entry with slug "appsignal" to data/organizations.yml.

Example: Update fields of an existing organization
    bin/rails g organization --slug appsignal --kind company --main_location "Amsterdam, Netherlands"

Example: Merge a duplicate into this organization
    bin/rails g organization --slug appsignal --alias-slug app-signal --alias-name "App Signal"
    bin/rails organizations_file:extract   # rewrites sponsors.yml and involvements.yml that used app-signal
